  "analyzed_vuln": {
    "function": "hls_transform_unit",
    "file": "ffmpeg/libavcodec/hevcdec.c",
    "description": "Out-of-bounds read on chroma QP offset tables in hls_transform_unit(): cu_chroma_qp_offset_idx is decoded from the bitstream and used directly to index s->ps.pps->cb_qp_offset_list / cr_qp_offset_list (size 5), with no bounds check against chroma_qp_offset_list_len_minus1 (or array size). In this PoV it reaches index 5, triggering UBSan at line ~1050.",
    "conditions": "Via HEVC slice parsing in ffmpeg_AV_CODEC_ID_HEVC_fuzzer, crafted PPS/slice syntax enables cu_chroma_qp_offset_enabled_flag and sets cu_chroma_qp_offset_flag plus cu_chroma_qp_offset_idx to an invalid value (>=5). During coding-unit -> transform-tree -> hls_transform_unit flow, decoder reads that index and accesses cb_qp_offset_list/cr_qp_offset_list out of bounds, causing UB/crash."
  },
